{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/c8a4e847831966756090ca95648c59fd.poster.avif?t=1772199937\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/c8a4e847831966756090ca95648c59fd.webm?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/c8a4e847831966756090ca95648c59fd.mp4?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race the skies to glory in Couch Planes, an airborne party game where the craftiest pilot wins. Tight flying meets over-the-top fun in this fast-paced joyride. Whether you\u2019re dodging missiles with friends on the couch or gunning for the leaderboard glory online, you\u2019ll feel the thrill of being an arcade stick jockey. Zip through hazard-filled maps, collecting race-changing power-ups, on your way towards the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Anywhere. Beat Everyone.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/96d0da3a5bbc1047c3339ad90275e032.poster.avif?t=1772199937\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/96d0da3a5bbc1047c3339ad90275e032.webm?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly solo, squad up, or turn game night into a friendly competition to see who is master of the skies. Couch Planes supports local 4-player split-screen and up to 12 players online, with support for mixing local and online pilots. Take it casual or get sweaty and dominate with precision flying. Either way, it\u2019s all systems go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Five Modes and One Goal: Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/8bf7b3deeeebc57ddafdee8f0e78ad36.poster.avif?t=1772199937\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/8bf7b3deeeebc57ddafdee8f0e78ad36.webm?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/8bf7b3deeeebc57ddafdee8f0e78ad36.mp4?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However you like to fly, there\u2019s a mode to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power-Up Pandemonium</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/184b85329d8018cb64b761a6e5b10a78.poster.avif?t=1772199937\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/184b85329d8018cb64b761a6e5b10a78.webm?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash mid-air balloons to unleash game-changing power-ups: homing rockets, speed boosts, exploding mines, and more. Items are balanced by your position, so no one\u2019s ever too far ahead\u2013or safe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tracks that Fight Back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/1c3715647a130dc23472816186171a76.poster.avif?t=1772199937\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/1c3715647a130dc23472816186171a76.webm?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/1c3715647a130dc23472816186171a76.mp4?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly across 15 handcrafted maps full of environmental hazards and goodies, from tornadoes and collapsing cliffs to power-up windmills and treasure-hauling steam trains. Thread the needle to take a shortcut, but misjudge and you\u2019ll be tasting your friend\u2019s afterburners.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Fly. Hard to Ace.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/42621292eedab366eec3a57db058a3a9.poster.avif?t=1772199937\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/42621292eedab366eec3a57db058a3a9.webm?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/42621292eedab366eec3a57db058a3a9.mp4?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, arcade controls make it easy to jump in, but there\u2019s plenty of depth under the hood. Learn to barrel roll past missiles, drift through tight turns, or flip your way out of trouble like a skyborne stunt master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full Throttle Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/4ea03c1efa95cc189023a4ea4de62fe9.poster.avif?t=1772199937\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/4ea03c1efa95cc189023a4ea4de62fe9.webm?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/4ea03c1efa95cc189023a4ea4de62fe9.mp4?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress while you play to earn cosmetics, including skins, trails, decals, and effects. And none of it affects performance. There\u2019s no pay-to-win nonsense here. Everyone competes on equal footing, but only the best look good doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Skies are Always Calling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/b8cdf3ba6f091441c60c7f0f86bc43a9.poster.avif?t=1772199937\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/b8cdf3ba6f091441c60c7f0f86bc43a9.webm?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With seasonal events, rotating shop items, ranked ladders, and evolving content, Couch Planes is always cooking up something new. Whether you're in for a quick match or chasing your next unlock, there\u2019s always a reason to jump back into the cockpit.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2431740?t=1772199937","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/86801ab28ba09ddec63e7e8ef6c09f908b83befc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772199937","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/bacf1f6e25bc1119ba1c1d792a7f9a37aa46b5c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772199937","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/bacf1f6e25bc1119ba1c1d792a7f9a37aa46b5c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772199937","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/c8a4e847831966756090ca95648c59fd.poster.avif?t=1772199937\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/c8a4e847831966756090ca95648c59fd.webm?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/c8a4e847831966756090ca95648c59fd.mp4?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race the skies to glory in Couch Planes, an airborne party game where the craftiest pilot wins. Tight flying meets over-the-top fun in this fast-paced joyride. Whether you\u2019re dodging missiles with friends on the couch or gunning for the leaderboard glory online, you\u2019ll feel the thrill of being an arcade stick jockey. Zip through hazard-filled maps, collecting race-changing power-ups, on your way towards the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Anywhere. Beat Everyone.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/96d0da3a5bbc1047c3339ad90275e032.poster.avif?t=1772199937\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/96d0da3a5bbc1047c3339ad90275e032.webm?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly solo, squad up, or turn game night into a friendly competition to see who is master of the skies. Couch Planes supports local 4-player split-screen and up to 12 players online, with support for mixing local and online pilots. Take it casual or get sweaty and dominate with precision flying. Either way, it\u2019s all systems go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Five Modes and One Goal: Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/8bf7b3deeeebc57ddafdee8f0e78ad36.poster.avif?t=1772199937\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/8bf7b3deeeebc57ddafdee8f0e78ad36.webm?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/8bf7b3deeeebc57ddafdee8f0e78ad36.mp4?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However you like to fly, there\u2019s a mode to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power-Up Pandemonium</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/184b85329d8018cb64b761a6e5b10a78.poster.avif?t=1772199937\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/184b85329d8018cb64b761a6e5b10a78.webm?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash mid-air balloons to unleash game-changing power-ups: homing rockets, speed boosts, exploding mines, and more. Items are balanced by your position, so no one\u2019s ever too far ahead\u2013or safe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tracks that Fight Back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/1c3715647a130dc23472816186171a76.poster.avif?t=1772199937\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/1c3715647a130dc23472816186171a76.webm?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/1c3715647a130dc23472816186171a76.mp4?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly across 15 handcrafted maps full of environmental hazards and goodies, from tornadoes and collapsing cliffs to power-up windmills and treasure-hauling steam trains. Thread the needle to take a shortcut, but misjudge and you\u2019ll be tasting your friend\u2019s afterburners.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Fly. Hard to Ace.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/42621292eedab366eec3a57db058a3a9.poster.avif?t=1772199937\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/42621292eedab366eec3a57db058a3a9.webm?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/42621292eedab366eec3a57db058a3a9.mp4?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, arcade controls make it easy to jump in, but there\u2019s plenty of depth under the hood. Learn to barrel roll past missiles, drift through tight turns, or flip your way out of trouble like a skyborne stunt master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full Throttle Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/4ea03c1efa95cc189023a4ea4de62fe9.poster.avif?t=1772199937\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/4ea03c1efa95cc189023a4ea4de62fe9.webm?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/4ea03c1efa95cc189023a4ea4de62fe9.mp4?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress while you play to earn cosmetics, including skins, trails, decals, and effects. And none of it affects performance. There\u2019s no pay-to-win nonsense here. Everyone competes on equal footing, but only the best look good doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Skies are Always Calling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/b8cdf3ba6f091441c60c7f0f86bc43a9.poster.avif?t=1772199937\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/b8cdf3ba6f091441c60c7f0f86bc43a9.webm?t=1772199937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With seasonal events, rotating shop items, ranked ladders, and evolving content, Couch Planes is always cooking up something new. Whether you're in for a quick match or chasing your next unlock, there\u2019s always a reason to jump back into the cockpit.</p>","developers":["Skylab Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akam